/**
 * Attraction names of real parks, for the attraction-overlap branch of
 * `ParkValidatorService.findDuplicates` (PAR-310). Fetched on 2026-10-02.
 *
 * The three Queue-Times rows no longer exist in the catalogue — PAR-245 and
 * PAR-309 merged them — so their names come from the feed that created them,
 * `queue-times.com/parks/<id>/queue_times.json`, and the names of the wiki
 * rows they were merged into from ThemeParks.wiki's
 * `/v1/entity/<id>/children` (entity type ATTRACTION, which is what the
 * attraction sync stores). Every other list is the park's
 * `GET /v1/parks/.../attractions` response, which leaves retired rows out
 * exactly as the detector does.
 */

